Package: tidemark
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tidemark contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/treyzar/tidemark
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-eng, tesseract-ocr-rus, xdg-desktop-portal
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Description: Native desktop island for Ubuntu
 Music controls, clipboard history, notes, timers and desktop tools.
 The GNOME adapter provides compositor integration for the desktop island.
